    {
      "index": 4,
      "className": "csp-story",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "THE SITUATION"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "An educational fintech company based in Germany whose Google Ads account produced leads, but at a high and unpredictable cost per acquisition."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Years of accumulated structure: broad match keywords cannibalising each other, no negative keyword lists, and conversion tracking that counted page views as leads. Nobody could say what a lead really cost."
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT WE CHANGED"
        },
        {
          "type": "ol",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Full account audit: 31% of spend was going to searches that could never convert",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Campaign rebuild with tight match types and shared negative keyword lists",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Conversion tracking rebuilt around real form submissions and qualified calls",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Landing page rewrite to lift Quality Score from 4 to 8 on the main keywords",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Bidding moved from manual CPC to Target CPA once the data was clean",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT HAPPENED"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Cost per lead fell 40% in 90 days while lead quality rose. The account now runs on clear attribution with a predictable cost per acquisition."
        }
      ]
    },
